      "start": 0.103,
      "end": 2.664,
      "text": "So, tell me a little about yourself.",
      "translation": "那么，请简单介绍一下你自己。",
      "notes": "重音：tell · little · yourself\n连读：tell me → tel-me；about yourself → abou-chur-self\n提示：tell me 的 m 和 a 连读；yourself 重音在 self。"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "s_0002",
      "start": 3.395,
      "end": 6.864,
      "text": "I've been working as a product designer for about three years.",
      "translation": "我做产品设计师大约三年了。",
      "notes": "重音：working · product · designer · three · years\n连读：as a → a-za；for about → fo-ra-bout\n提示：I've been 弱读成 aiv-bin，重点信息放在 three years。"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "s_0003",
      "start": 7.592,
      "end": 9.759,
      "text": "What made you want to apply for this role?",
      "translation": "是什么让你想申请这个职位？",
      "notes": "重音：What · want · apply · role\n连读：want to → wanna；apply for → apply-fer\n提示：want to 口语里常说 wanna；apply 重音在第二音节。"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "s_0004",
      "start": 10.487,
      "end": 13.483,
      "text": "I'm really drawn to your focus on accessibility.",
      "translation": "我真的很被你们对无障碍设计的专注吸引。",
      "notes": "重音：really · drawn · focus · accessibility\n连读：drawn to → drawn-tuh；focus on → focu-son\n提示：drawn to 连读；accessibility 重音在 bil。"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "s_0005",
      "start": 14.211,
      "end": 17.496,
      "text": "That's great to hear. When could you start?",
      "translation": "很高兴听你这么说。你什么时候能入职？",
      "notes": "重音：great · hear · When · start\n连读：could you → coul-joo\n提示：could you 连读成 coul-joo，句尾 start 降调。"
    }
  ],
